{"id":"vod_lz_63656","vodId":"63656","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"JOJO的奇妙冒险 不灭钻石国语","name_cn":"JOJO的奇妙冒险 不灭钻石国语","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230611-1/eb22bce37da3460169f8d25f16a4bcfd.jpg"},"summary":"为了寻找外公乔瑟夫的私生子，空条承太郎（小野大辅 配音）来到了杜王町，名为东方仗助（小野友树 配音）的高中一年级男生正是空条承太郎要寻找的人，让承太郎没有想到的是，东方仗助拥有着和自己一样的“替身”能力。　　身材矮小但拥有强大意志力的广濑康一（梶裕贵 配音），大脑一根筋但对待朋友忠诚不二的虹村亿泰（高木涉 配音），自大而又偏执的人气漫画家岸边露伴（樱井孝宏 配音），围绕在东方仗助身边的，是这些有趣而又强大的朋友和队友们，与此同时，越来越多的替身使者亦接连浮出水面。当罪恶的魔爪伸向杜王町之时，东方仗助愿意以自己的生命为代价，保护这片他热爱的土地。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-11 12:34:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":39,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26722_1e860a39/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26721_7d3808dd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26720_87657eba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26723_36c3cfe6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26724_9ec892cf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26727_2ee68d32/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26729_a692e8de/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26725_345d6da9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26726_6b1414fa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26728_5367b660/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26730_c1473dcc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26731_90049b8d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26732_f596e2df/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230607/26735_bbe2eaa7/index.m3u8"},